{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:16.035+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"夕暮れの山道を抜けると、苔むした石段が現れた。","translation":"석양이 낀 산길을 지나니, 이끼 낀 돌계단이 나타났다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:27.177+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:27.177+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九、ここが月影のよ。間違いないわ","translation":"츠쿠모, 여기가 월계의 빛이야. 틀림없어"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:37.729+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"구십구"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:37.729+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"はい、シュザンヌ様。足元にお気をつけください","translation":"네, 슈잔느님. 발밑을 조심해 주세요"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:47.249+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:28:47.249+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ様、お急ぎになりませぬよう。年寄りの足には堪えますので","translation":"쉬잔님, 서두르지 않으시길 바랍니다. 어르신의 발은 참 고통스러우니."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:00.399+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:00.399+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ、大丈夫よ。ゆっくり行きましょう","translation":"에르베, 괜찮아. 천천히 가자"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:09.692+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"츠쿠모"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:09.692+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェさん、肩をお貸ししますよ","translation":"에르베 씨, 어깨를 빌려 드릴게요"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:18.664+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:18.664+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九、お前こそ剣を落とすなよ","translation":"츠쿠모, 네 놈도 검을 떨어뜨리지 마."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:27.738+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"石段の先に、錆びた門が月明かりに浮かんでいた。","translation":"돌 계단 끝에, 녹슨 문이 달빛에 떠 있었다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:38.845+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:38.845+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"見て、九十九。門の奥で何かが光ってる","translation":"저기, 츠쿠모. 문 안쪽에서 무언가가 빛나고 있어."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:48.751+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハク","translation":"하쿠"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:29:48.751+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"待っておったぞ、旅の者たち。我はこの月影の祠の番人、ハクじゃ","translation":"기다리고 있었구나, 여행자 여러분. 나는 이 월영 사당의 관리인, 하쿠다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:00.757+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:00.757+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ様、あれが祠の番人ですか。獣の姿をしておりますな","translation":"쉬잔님, 저기가 신사 지킴이요? 짐승의 모습으로 있네요."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:13.659+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:13.659+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハクと言ったわね。九十九、剣から手を離しなさ","translation":"하쿠라고 했어. 츠쿠모, 검에서 손을 떼지 마"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:13.659+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"い","translation":"이"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:28.930+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"구십구"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:28.930+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"はい、ですがシュザンヌ様、ハクという者から月涙石の気配がします","translation":"네, 하지만 슈잔느님, 하쿠라는 분에게서 달눈물석의 기운이 느껴집니다"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:40.935+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハク","translation":"하쿠"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:40.935+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"月涙石を持つ者だけが、夜明けの守り手に会える。それが祠の掟じゃ","translation":"월루석을 가진 자만이 새벽지기에 만날 수 있다. 그것은 사제의 규칙이다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:54.048+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:30:54.048+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"夜明けの守り手の話は、古い書物で読んだ覚えがございます","translation":"새벽지기의 이야기는, 낡은 책에서 읽은 기억이 있습니다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:06.718+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:06.718+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"それなら話が早いわ。エルヴェ、続きを聞かせて","translation":"그렇다면 이야기가 빨리 진행될 거야. 에르베, 계속해서 이야기해 줘."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:17.739+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:17.739+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"はい。夜明けの守り手は、月石に宿る光で眠りから覚めると申します","translation":"네. 새벽지기는, 월석에 깃든 빛으로 잠자리에서 깨어난다고 합니다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:30.695+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハクの尻尾が、青白く揺れた。","translation":"하쿠의 꼬리가 푸르스름하게 흔들렸다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:39.128+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハク","translation":"하쿠"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:39.128+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"月涙石は月影のの奥、水鏡の底に沈んでおる。取ってこられるかな","translation":"월루석은 월영의 오크, 수경의 속에 잠겨 있오. 가져올 수 있을까?"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:52.445+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"츠쿠모"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:31:52.445+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェさん、水鏡って冷たいんですか","translation":"에르베 씨, 수경이 차가운 건가요"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:01.595+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:01.595+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"冷たいだけならよいがな。底は、触れた者の迷いを映すのじゃ","translation":"차가울 뿐이라면 좋겠네. 바닥은, 만지는 사람의 망상을 비추는 것이야."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:14.163+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:14.163+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九、私が行くわ。この月影のは私の家の先祖が建てたのよ","translation":"츠쿠모, 내가 간다. 이 월영의 것은 내 집 조상의 것이었어."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:27.149+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"구십구"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:27.149+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ様、いけません。水鏡には私が参ります","translation":"슈잔느님, 안 됩니다. 제가 물거울에 가겠습니다"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:37.795+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:37.795+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"頑固ね。じゃあ、二人で行きましょう","translation":"고집 센 사람인데, 둘이서 가자."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:46.986+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:32:46.986+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"お供できず申し訳ございません。ここで月影のをお守りいたします","translation":"함께 할 수 없어 정말 죄송합니다. 여기서 월영의 오보를 하겠습니다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:00.995+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"二人は水鏡の緑に立った。月の光が、静かに揺れ","translation":"두 사람은 물결 거울의 녹색에 서 있었다. 달빛이 조용히 흔들렸다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:00.995+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"てい","translation":"테이"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:12.194+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"츠쿠모"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:12.194+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ様、私の手をお取りください","translation":"쉬잔ヌ様、私の手をお取りください"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:21.570+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:21.570+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ありがとう、九十九。行くわよ","translation":"고마워, 츠쿠모. 가겠어"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:30.437+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"水の底で、月涙石が青く脈打っていた。","translation":"물의 바닥에서, 월루석이 파랗게 맥打고 있었다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:39.814+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"츠쿠모"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:39.814+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ様、ありました。これが月涙石です","translation":"쉬잔ヌ様、ありました。これが 월루석 입니다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:50.204+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"シュザンヌ","translation":"쉬잔"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:50.204+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"持ち上げて、九十九。ゆっくりよ","translation":"들고 가, 츠쿠모. 천천히"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:33:59.137+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"石が光を放ち、月影の全体が低く震え出した。","translation":"돌이 빛을 내뿜고, 달빛 그림자가 아래로 흔들리기 시작했다."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:09.917+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"ハク","translation":"하쿠"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:09.917+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"よくやった。目覚めの時じゃ、夜明けの守り手よ","translation":"잘 했어. 새벽지기다"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:20.351+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"エルヴェ","translation":"에르베"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:20.351+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九、よく無事でいたな。シュザンヌ様を頼んだぞ","translation":"츠쿠모, 잘 지내고 있었구나. 쉬잔에게 부탁했지."}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:31.276+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"九十九","translation":"츠쿠모"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:31.276+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"はい、エルヴェさんのおかげです","translation":"네, 에르베 씨 덕분입니다"}
{"time":"2026-10-20T19:34:40.168+09:00","lens":"Lens","app":"dev.midagedev.film.lumiere","source":"ja","target":"ko","engine":"Ollama gemma3:4b","original":"夜明けの守り手が、ゆっくりと目を開いた。","translation":"새벽지기가, 천천히 눈을 떴다."}
